# OpenSlide backend. openslide-bin ships the prebuilt OpenSlide C library as a
# wheel (Linux/macOS/Windows), so `import openslide` works in Bazel's sandbox
# and in CI without vendoring the OpenSlide C graph or relying on a system
# install. openslide-python (>=1.4) auto-loads the library from openslide-bin.
openslide-python
openslide-bin

